      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Rule 4: if the parcel arrives while Alice is still wanted, Bob must hear about it (or already be on his way).\nIf the parcel never arrives, nobody owes anyone a call. \"Not yet\" does not promise a call-back.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1588437586,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Rule 4: if the parcel arrives while Alice is still wanted, Bob must hear about it (or already be on his way).\nIf the parcel never arrives, nobody owes anyone a call. \"Not yet\" does not promise a call-back.",
